    "created_at": "2018-05-30T06:42:56Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-30T06:42:56Z",
    "body": "The main reason we removed `[ArrayClass]` is that tagging it on things we wanted it for, e.g., `NodeList`, wasn't web-compatible. And for new lists we generally want folks to return arrays.\r\n\r\nSo therefore our options seem to be:\r\n\r\n1. Accept the inefficiency and slight inelegance of `[...obj].find(callback)` (and perhaps try to optimize it if it becomes a pattern).\r\n2. See if TC39 is interested is interested in a more elegant and efficient API for objects that have `@@iterator`. @domenic might know this?\r\n3. Test which `Array` properties we can add to IDL iterators without breaking the web and add them.",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
    "reactions": {
      "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/whatwg/webidl/issues/comments/393048033/reactions",
