    "updated_at": "2018-05-30T10:06:15Z",
    "body": "For 1, it's definitely already a pattern (with `Array.from()`, presumedly because Edge only just got full iterator support for `NodeList`): see [sample query on github](https://github.com/search?q=Array.from+querySelectorAll&type=Code). \r\n",
