    "updated_at": "2018-05-30T13:44:50Z",
    "body": "IMO if you want an array, you should not be using `iterable<>`. You should be using an array. `iterable<>` is when you need to create some completely custom collection, e.g. `DOMTokenList` (a type of set), `URLSearchParams` (a multi-map), or when you need to adapt legacy array-likes.",
