    "created_at": "2018-05-31T05:46:02Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-05-31T05:46:02Z",
    "body": "I looked it up: the specific compat issue was people doing .concat() on nodelists because they tested true for instanceof Array.  So nodelists that were ArrayClass and implemented @@isConcatSpreadable would not have had the one known compat issue.\r\n\r\nThe real issue was that no one except Gecko was interested in implementing [ArrayClass]...",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
