    "created_at": "2018-07-23T03:21:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-07-23T03:21:26Z",
    "body": "> I hope the ES array methods (edit: optionally) use Symbol.iterator rather than requiring length property\r\n\r\nWhich methods?\r\n\r\nGenerally speaking, the Array generics in ES in fact use the `length` property; they were mostly designed before iterators existed and were meant to work on arbitrary arraylikes.",
