    "body": ">Which methods?\r\n\r\nNearly all, except `push()` and `pop()` which won't work with iterators, so that this can just work:\r\n\r\n```js\r\nArray.prototype.find.call(iterableWithoutLength, fn); // does not creates a new array\r\n```",
